        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The team at Valley Village Dental is dedicated to offering the highest quality dental care in the greater Los Angeles area, and part of our commitment to our patients includes getting to know you! We value your time and provide comprehensive and educational care that addresses your individual needs.",
